Subject: [PATCH 11/24] =?UTF-8?q?fix(vintf):=20=E5=8E=BB=E6=8E=89=E6=8C=87?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E7=BA=B9=20HAL=20=E7=9A=84=E9=87=8D=E5=A4=8D=E5=A3=B0=E6=98=8E?=
